Holaq
$cards
DECK 1 {SPADES, CLUBS}

$initial
DRUN 8 FACE_LAST
DRUN 8 FACE_ALL

UVIC 5 FACE_HALF
UVIC 5 FACE_ALL

$moves
MOVE DRUN DRUN
OR
    DEST Size >= 7
    DESTSRC Suit match
MOVE DRUN UVIC
DEST Suit {HEARTS}
MOVE_STACK {DRUN, UVIC} DRUN
OR
    AND
        SRC Suit {DIAMONDS}
        DESTSRC Rank ascending
    DEST Rank 1
$win
PILE ALL UVIC Empty
